# MES Assets is the ONE app that talks to chain/price APIs; every other dashboard reads its
# /api/holdings feed. Most sources are keyless - only the three things below need setup.
#
# Wallet addresses live in src/lib/config.ts (HIVE_ACCOUNT, EVM_ADDRESSES, XRP_ADDRESS), not here.

# --- Prices (recommended) ---

# CoinGecko free "Demo" API key (coingecko.com/en/api/pricing). Prices HIVE/HBD/BTC/ETH/BNB/XRP/HYPE
# in one call, plus BNB Chain token prices by contract. WITHOUT a key CoinGecko allows only ONE
# contract per request, so BNB Chain tokens are priced slowly and only the first ~40 per refresh;
# with a key they batch 50 per call.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# --- BNB Chain tokens ---

# NodeReal MegaNode API key (dashboard.nodereal.io, free tier) - the same key the ai/mfa/sov
# projects already use. BNB Chain is the only chain here with no keyless indexer, so a one-off
# scan of received BEP-20s (nr_getAssetTransfers) discovers which tokens each wallet has held.
# That scan is cached for 12h and is NOT cleared by the Refresh button, so it costs very few
# credits. Without this key BNB Chain still shows native BNB and PancakeSwap V3 positions, just
# not BEP-20 tokens (e.g. BTCB) - the Data sources panel says so.
NODEREAL_API_KEY=

# --- Caching (needed in production) ---

# Upstash Redis (or the Vercel KV integration, which sets the same variable names). Each source's
# holdings are cached 10 min, prices 3 min, BNB Chain discovery 12h, and the last good copy is kept
# for a week so an upstream outage shows stale data instead of a blank page. Local dev works
# without these (falls back to an in-process cache).
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# --- Optional overrides (all have working keyless defaults) ---

# XRPL_RPC_URL=https://xrplcluster.com/
# HIVE_ENGINE_RPC_URL=https://api.hive-engine.com/rpc
# MAGI_API_URL=https://api.okinoko.io/api/v1/graphql
# MAGI_INDEXER_URL=https://api.okinoko.io/hasura/v1/graphql
# Public JSON-RPC used for BNB Chain balances and LP-position reads (tried before the built-in fallbacks):
# ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=  ARBITRUM_RPC_URL=  POLYGON_RPC_URL=  BASE_RPC_URL=  OPTIMISM_RPC_URL=  BSC_RPC_URL=  HYPEREVM_RPC_URL=
